<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.4500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.4500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.4500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75.4999 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 16		 June 13</p>
<p> High			     75.6000		 75.4999</p>
<p> Low				75.4500		 75.3000</p>
<p> Open			     75.6000		 75.3100</p>
<p> Close			    75.4500		 75.4999</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    4.550		   3.625</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
